@ambient/models

Derived from @handy-computer/models 0.2.3
(https://github.com/handy-computer/models), published by the Handy project
(https://github.com/cjpais/Handy) under the MIT License; see LICENSE. The
model conversions listed in catalog.json were published by the same project
and are redistributed from Ambient's Hugging Face account under each model's
own license (the `license` field of each entry).

Changes from the published package: renamed to @ambient/models; catalog.json
points each model at Ambient's Hugging Face copy (same files and hashes, new
repository and revision, previous revisions cleared) and drops the VAD and
diarization models Ambient doesn't download; the README was rewritten and
references to the upstream project were reworded. dist/ is otherwise the
published build.
